    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "AIS treats whether a source is correct or trustworthy as a separate evaluation from whether the generated text accurately represents it. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://arxiv.org/html/2112.12870v2",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:f67a7d4b2cdeaf6aefade19a48804778801435a0cd8f4290dff16a970783879d",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:4d34b9d3e516e3082015cfac1924068ed2280fc45e932c50b1cb7a487a09c519"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "FActScore computes the fraction of a generation's atomic facts that a reliable knowledge source supports. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://aclanthology.org/2023.emnlp-main.741.pdf",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:c2c3f1e6c100b66285c6b666c2c9b790c5031f8d5c5ab51cb6f467d7ac82779a",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:36ca580a0ba1cd07ccdc8dcd7caaa36325e3081daa7b12ef14013236bcc332ec"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ALCE's citation-precision evaluation penalizes irrelevant citations without requiring the citation set to be minimal. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://aclanthology.org/2023.emnlp-main.398.pdf",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:c35da2c14dd6c6a96573bc6b8021c7f89c06b3851e640d7e62be420aea3f8337",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:8605342b2095ea98a0d1740c45fe0cd8e851e9e5b7d6eafcb00559c489cc58fb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ALCE evaluates fluency, correctness, and citation quality as separate dimensions. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://aclanthology.org/2023.emnlp-main.398.pdf",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:a8049f9adb34c5b2b0566273b41b06ab40b375f746669d0f934b11c55f0a0424",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:f755b92442bd3fee90a1ba44b67cdf77928db5fe4011107f64117bf33152047d"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIS resolves a sentence's interpretation using its linguistic context and the relevant time before judging attribution. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://arxiv.org/html/2112.12870v2",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:8eeb994d6342d409313b4e7292ec5e1708dd3836eeb106380f82649d1916700e",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:6e83db270c8db2ea0115d90578dcac7a5d98d3e0b116e0e1809e73872e7bf985"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "FActScore does not measure factual recall and does not penalize a response merely for providing fewer facts. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://aclanthology.org/2023.emnlp-main.741.pdf",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:13bc05c63c529b538258514570a451c98ada9c496765bd2e35f8281ee4860554",
